  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8958357d8b8d9084f81f350ec5364699, type: 3}
  m_Name: Figma Converter MCP
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DisplayName: Figma Converter for Unity
  EndpointPath: fcu
  Instructions: "Before using FCU tools, read fcu://instances. If there is more than
    one FigmaConverterUnity instance, ask the user which one to use, then call select_fcu_instance
    with the selected instance id. Continue all FCU work with that selected instance.\n\nImport
    flow:\n1. set_project_url\n2. download_project\n3. read fcu://frame-list
    and follow the returned frame-selection instructions\n4. select_frames\n5.
    start_import_step with {\"step_index\": 0}\n6. If start_import_step returns
    pause_reason=SpriteDuplicateRemover, show the returned user_message to the user
    in their language. Do not show internal action names, JSON field names, or a command
    list. Interpret their answer: use sprite_duplicate_resolution=apply_default for
    the default selection, sprite_duplicate_resolution=keep_all_duplicates to keep
    duplicates, or wait for the user to finish manual selection in Unity and then continue
    with next_step while omitting sprite_duplicate_resolution.\n7. If start_import_step
    returns requires_user_action=true for any other reason, wait for the user to finish
    the Unity window, then call start_import_step with the returned next_step. Repeat
    until the import is completed."
  McpTools:
